// Two thousand functions no call reaches, plus a `main` that calls
// one. What a build costs for the code it does not use: the entry is
// four lines and everything else is dead weight the pipeline would
// otherwise lower, optimise, emit as IR, and hand to LLVM.
//
// Generated shape, checked in so the gate measures the same program on
// every host.

